# Show Interfering Parts on a screw and its nut, of clearance 0, linked
# in phase: their ridges collide, though the Boolean of their shells
# fails on the helical flanks lying on each other, and the message
# gives the volume their meshes share, marked as such.
file $testdata/thread/screw_m8.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
file $testdata/thread/nut_m8.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
answer ok
menu Assembly|Show Interfering Parts
